N        EQU   16
INPUT    EQU   1000
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  N/2         H1. Initialize. l ← ⌊N/2⌋ + 1.
         ENT2  N-1         r ← N.
1H       DEC1  1           l ← l − 1.
         LDA   INPUT+1,1   R ← Rl, K ← Kl.
3H       ENT4  1,1         H3. Prepare for siftup. j ← l.
         ENT5  0,2
         DEC5  0,1         rI5 ← r − j.
         JMP   4F          To H4.
5H       LDX   INPUT,4     H5. Find larger child.
         CMPX  INPUT+1,4
         JGE   6F          Jump if Kj ≥ Kj+1.
         INC4  1           Otherwise set j ← j + 1.
         DEC5  1
9H       LDX   INPUT,4     rX ← Rj.
6H       CMPA  INPUT,4     H6. Larger than K?
         JGE   8F          To H8 if K ≥ Kj.
7H       STX   INPUT,3     H7. Move it up. Ri ← Rj.
4H       ENT3  0,4         H4. Advance downward. i ← j.
         DEC5  0,4         rI5 ← rI5 − j.
         INC4  0,4         j ← j + j.
         J5P   5B          To H5 if j < r.
         J5Z   9B          To H6 if j = r.
8H       STA   INPUT,3     H8. Store R. Ri ← R.
2H       J1P   1B          H2. Decrease l or r.
         LDA   INPUT+1,2   If l = 1, set R ← Rr, K ← Kr.
         LDX   INPUT+1
         STX   INPUT+1,2   Rr ← R1.
         DEC2  1           r ← r − 1.
         J2P   3B          To H3 if r > 1.
         STA   INPUT+1     R1 ← R.
         HLT
         END   START
